14	3	5	\N	Tasmania	tasmania-1e354776-d4bb-449c-b017-a0834df0ea38	0	2016-07-04 06:59:55.545489	2016-07-10 23:30:17.709025	GeneralContent	\N	published	f4d28d76-644d-4d9e-b536-09824bbaeca3	\N	\N	{"content_body": "###2016  \\r\\n\\r\\n####Daylight saving ends  \\r\\n   \\r\\n__3 April 2016 at 2am__  \\r\\n_Put your clocks back by one hour_  \\r\\n    \\r\\n  \\r\\n####Daylight saving starts  \\r\\n  \\r\\n__2 October 2016 at 2am__  \\r\\n_Put your clocks forward by one hour_  \\r\\n     \\r\\n\\r\\n####2017\\r\\n\\r\\n####Daylight saving ends\\r\\n\\r\\n__2 April 2017 at 2am__  \\r\\n_Put your clocks back by one hour_\\r\\n  \\r\\n  \\r\\n####Daylight saving starts\\r\\n\\r\\n__1 October 2017 at 2am__  \\r\\n_Put your clocks forward by one hour_  \\r\\n  \\r\\n \\r\\n***\\r\\n###Time zones\\r\\n\\r\\n__Tasmania is currently in Australian Eastern Standard Time (AEST)__  \\r\\n\\r\\n####Time zones in other states and territories\\r\\n\\r\\n__Australian Capital Territory__  \\r\\nCurrently in Australian Eastern Standard Time (AEST)  \\r\\n_The same time as Tasmania_  \\r\\n\\r\\n__New South Wales (except Broken Hill)__  \\r\\nCurrently in Australian Eastern Standard Time (AEST)  \\r\\n_The same time as Tasmania_  \\r\\n\\r\\n__Northern Territory__  \\r\\nCurrently in Australian Central Standard Time (ACST)  \\r\\n_Half an hour behind Tasmania_  \\r\\n\\r\\n__Queensland__  \\r\\nCurrently in Australian Eastern Standard Time (AEST)  \\r\\n_The same time as Tasmania_  \\r\\n\\r\\n__South Australia (and Broken Hill, NSW)__  \\r\\nCurrently in Australian Central Standard Time (ACST)  \\r\\n_Half an hour behind Tasmania_  \\r\\n\\r\\n__Victoria__  \\r\\nCurrently in Australian Eastern Standard Time (AEST)  \\r\\n_The same time as Tasmania_  \\r\\n\\r\\n__Western Australia__  \\r\\nCurrently in Australian Western Standard Time (AWST)  \\r\\n_Two hours behind Tasmania_  \\r\\n\\r\\n__Daylight saving is observed in the Australian Capital Territory, New South Wales, South Australia, Tasmania and Victoria__  \\r\\n\\r\\n__Daylight saving is not observed in the Northern Territory, Queensland or Western Australia__  "}
